### 📋 Tender Briefing: High End Desktop
Issued by **National Institute of Technology Karnataka** | Ref: `NITK/DPD/OH35-MECH/2024-25/A9-4` | Submission Deadline: **Refer to Tender Schedule**

#### 🏛️ What This Tender Is About
What this tender is about: Tender for High End Desktop under National Institute of Technology Karnataka.

#### ⚙️ Procurement Opportunity & Scope
- **Main Technical Scope**: Implementation scope covering High End Desktop.
- **Estimated Tender Value**: ₹ 47,25,000.00 (Including GST)
- **Implementation Timeline**: One month
- **Submission Deadline**: **Refer to Tender Schedule**
- **Contract Duration & Warranty**: NOT FOUND (Warranty Period: 5-Years Comprehensive Onsite Warranty)

#### 🎯 Key Eligibility Requirements
- **Minimum Turnover**: Turnover must be 30% of the estimated cost
- **Past Similar Experience**: NOT FOUND
- **OEM Authorization (MAF)**: Generic specifications; no explicit single-brand restriction
- **Consortium / Joint Venture**: NOT FOUND

> ℹ️ **Bidder eligibility**: Not assessed — company credentials have not been provided. Click any suggested question below or ask me directly to evaluate your profile.

#### 💳 Key Financial Commitments
- **EMD / Bid Security**: Exemption available for registered MSMEs/MSEs as per policy (Tender Fee: Nil / Free (No tender fee required))
- **Performance Security (PBG)**: Performance Security amounting to 3%of the purchase order value in favor of "The Director, NITK Surathkal"
- **Payment Terms**: Payment within 30 days from the date of delivery,installation andacceptance certificate of concerned Department/Section/Purchase Section
- **Warranty Period**: 5-Years Comprehensive Onsite Warranty
- **Delay Penalties / Liquidated Damages**: Liquidated Damages for the delay, unless covered under Force Majeure conditions aforesaid, @ 1% per week or part of the week of the delayed period as pre-estimated damages not exceeding 5% of the contract value without any controversy/dispute of any sort whatsoever

#### ⚠️ Critical Risks & Watchouts
- **🟠 Liquidated Damages and Strict Delivery Timeline**: Tight supply chain or OEM manufacturing lead times may trigger financial deductions (Page 6)

