b3 Key Financial Commitments\n- **EMD / Bid Security**: Rs. 70,00,000 (Tender Fee: Nil / As per portal)\n- **Performance Security (PBG)**: NOT SPECIFIED / Governed by Security Deposit (5% retained as performance guarantee)\n- **Payment Terms**: NOT FOUND\n- **Warranty Period**: 3 years onsite warranty\n- **Delay Penalties / Liquidated Damages**: Delay for Supply & installation of the equipment Rate of penalty Delay up to 1 week after allowable time schedule. 0.5 % of the product cost which are yet to be supplied. Up to 2nd week after allowable time limit. 1% of the product cost which are yet to be supplied Up to 3rd week after 2 % of the product cost which are yet to be Up to 4th week after 3 % of the product cost which are yet to be 5th 4 % of the product cost which are yet to be More than 5 weeks after 5% of the product cost which are yet to be \"The maximum penalty for delay in completion of supply shall be restricted to 5% of the cost of the products remaining to be supplied / installed.\" (b) Penalty for non-fulfillment of tender conditions: Penalty will be levied at 5% on the total value of project cost or the actual loss incurred to the Department whichever is higher if the Scope of the project is not achieved and conditions stipulated in the Contract Agreement are not fulfilled. (c) Penalty for breakdown during warranty period: Any defect, malfunction or failure in the CCTV system and its related equipment/components supplied, installed and commissioned under this project shall be attended to by the vendor on the same day of receipt of the complaint from the Department. The supplier shall ensure 100% rectification and restoration of the defective/non-functional equipment or system within a maximum period of 48 hours from the time of receipt of the complaint, either by repairing the equipment, replacing the defective component/item, or taking such corrective action as may be required. Other wise penalty will be levied as detailed below: Breakdown Period Up to