========== FINAL RESPONSE ==========
18. EXACT final response:
### 📌 Answer: Payment Terms & Warranty Commitments
- **Payment Milestones**: Payment terms will be on back-to-back basis, i.e., payment will be made only on receipt of payment from customer. Scheduled Breakdown: 25% Mobilization Advance of total tender value on completion of selection process of Implementation Partner.; For ANPR & CCTV System --- 60% on completion of delivery of all active and passive equipment to site/district, as per delivery schedule agreed.; For Body Worn Camera & Night Vision Binocular --- 75% on completion of full delivery of materials including operational training.; For ANPR & CCTV System --- Balance 15% on completion of installation and commissioning in all sites. *(Page 1)*
- **Warranty Duration**: **3 Years comprehensive warranty on all components for ANPR & CCTV System from the date of go-live of the system and 1 Year Warranty for Body Worn Camera & Night Vision Binocular from the date of supply**
- **Performance Security (PBG)**: Performance Bank Guarantee (PBG) equivalent to 10% of the total contract value within three weeks from the date of receipt of Letter of Award/Order. The PBG should be valid for six month more than the warranty period.
- **Delay Penalties / Liquidated Damages**: 17. LIQUIDATED DAMAGE Hardware: LD clause: I. 0.5% of the total Hardware bill value of this segment for every 7 days delay in meeting the delivery schedule II. The maximum deductible is capped at 5% of the total year wise SLA value. III. Vendor Termination Clause: - Termination possibility of MSI in the case of multiple cases of failure to meet SLA terms beyond monthly commitments for 6 continuous months
- **Service Level Agreement (SLA)**: OEM on-site support with mandatory ticket resolution and spare parts availability.

### 📄 Tender Evidence
- Section: Commercial Terms & Conditions — Payments & Warranty, Page 1.
- Document: Tendernotice_1 (1).pdf

### 💡 Consultant Interpretation
- **Working Capital Strain**: Milestone payments subject to client inspection sign-offs can create 60-90 day cash flow gaps.
- **Warranty Costs**: Comprehensive warranty obligations require factoring OEM back-to-back warranty costs into the bid price.

### 🎯 Recommended Action
- Ensure OEM back-to-back warranty terms match or exceed the tender tenure.
- Clarify whether advance payment is available against bank guarantee during pre-bid queries.
========== FINAL RESPONSE END ==========

